<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork at 1115 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork at 1115 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fresh loins unevenly steady; butts mostly $1.00 higher; sknd. hams 17-20 lbs $1.00-2.00 higher, 20-26 lbs mostly $3.00 lower; sdls. bellies 12-14 lbs $1.00 lower in light test; lean trimmings $3.00 lower.</p>
<p>Trading very slow, with light demand and light to moderate</p>
<p>offerings. -USDA</p>
